0006F9r 1               ; levels
0006F9r 1               ;   total, need, release rate, time (seconds, BCD, low byte first),
0006F9r 1               ;   skills: climber, floater, blocker, builder, basher, digger,
0006F9r 1               ;   hatch x, y (where creatures appear), exit x, y (where they stand),
0006F9r 1               ;   name ($FF), then terrain commands, 0:
0006F9r 1               ;     'R', x, y, w, h     filled rectangle
0006F9r 1               ;     'U', x, y, w        ramp of w columns rising to the right, base row y
0006F9r 1               ;     'D', x, y, w        ramp falling to the right
0006F9r 1               ; The playfield is 160 x 88 pixels.
